source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Jira renders a heading inside the cell, which a GFM cell cannot hold.
-- input.jira --
||h||
|h1. x|
-- rendered.html --
<div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<th class='confluenceTh'>h</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><h1><a name="x"></a>x</h1></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
-- want.md --
| h |
| --- |
| h1. x |
-- warnings.json --
[
  {
    "Line": 2,
    "Column": 2,
    "Construct": "table",
    "Reason": "Jira renders a heading inside this table cell; JFM keeps its text"
  }
]
